@startuml
[*] --> Upload Initiated
Upload Initiated --> File Size Check : User initiates file upload
File Size Check --> File Upload in Progress : File size <= 5MB
File Upload in Progress --> File Uploaded : Upload completes successfully
File Uploaded --> [*] : User views details and downloads file
File Size Check --> Prompt for Smaller File : File size > 5MB
Prompt for Smaller File --> Upload Initiated : User chooses to upload smaller file
Prompt for Smaller File --> [*] : User cancels upload
@enduml
